---
---
<section class="min-h-[85vh] relative flex items-center border-b border-white/[0.06]">
  <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-end">
      <div class="lg:col-span-8">
        <span class="hero-reveal label block mb-8">Gabriel Freeman, GLF Analytics, Los Angeles</span>

        <h1 class="hero-reveal hero-reveal--delay-1">
          <span class="block heading-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[4.75rem] xl:text-[5.5rem] text-white leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.03em]">
            The data and the tech
          </span>
          <span class="block heading-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[4.75rem] xl:text-[5.5rem] text-white leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.03em] mt-1 md:mt-2">
            behind growing brands.
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-reveal hero-reveal--delay-2 mt-8 md:mt-12 text-surface-400 text-base md:text-lg max-w-xl leading-relaxed font-light">
          I help businesses grow with numbers. Since 2017 that has meant building the warehouses and reporting, running the growth strategy, and managing the websites, apps, and systems that run the day to day, for brands, restaurant groups, and startups. Lately it also means AI tooling inside that same stack.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-reveal hero-reveal--delay-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mt-10 md:mt-14">
          <a href="mailto:gabrielf@glfanalytics.com" class="btn-primary group">
            <span>Email me</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="relative z-10 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#selected-work" class="btn-secondary">
            <span>See the work</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4 hero-reveal hero-reveal--delay-4">
        <div class="lg:pl-8 lg:border-l border-white/[0.06] space-y-6">
          <div>
            <span class="block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-gold-500 mb-2">Since 2017</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">eCommerce and CPG, restaurants and delivery, DTC startups. BigQuery, SQL, Looker Studio, GA4, Shopify, Klaviyo, Meta and Google Ads, Uber Eats and DoorDash.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-gold-500 mb-2">How I work</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">Exploration first, then a short ranked list, then a build that ships in weeks. You keep the systems, the reporting, and the runbook.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const heroItems = document.querySelectorAll(".hero-reveal");
  if (heroItems.length) {
    window.requestAnimationFrame(() => {
      heroItems.forEach((item) => item.classList.add("is-visible"));
    });
  }
</script>

<style is:global>
  .hero-reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    transition: opacity 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .hero-reveal.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  .hero-reveal--delay-1 { transition-delay: 150ms; }
  .hero-reveal--delay-2 { transition-delay: 350ms; }
  .hero-reveal--delay-3 { transition-delay: 500ms; }
  .hero-reveal--delay-4 { transition-delay: 650ms; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-reveal {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
